<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">SHARE A LITTLE JOY</view><view class="title section">{{editingId?'更新这份快乐':'好玩的滑梯，值得被找到。'}}</view><view class="subtitle">留下准确的位置，让下一位探索者少走弯路。</view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">01　标记位置 *</text><button class="location" bindtap="choose"><text class="pin">◎</text><view class="grow"><view>{{form.latitude!==null?'已选择位置 · 点击重新选择':'在地图上选择滑梯位置'}}</view><view class="muted">{{form.address||'请尽量标记到滑梯所在位置，而非公园大门'}}</view></view><text>›</text></button></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">02　给它一个名字 *</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如：河畔公园的小象滑梯" maxlength="40" value="{{form.title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="input" /></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">详细地址 *</text><input class="input" placeholder="补充入口、楼层或附近标志物" maxlength="160" value="{{form.address}}" data-field="address" bindinput="input" /></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">现场照片（选填，最多6张）</text><view class="photo-grid"><view wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="path" class="photo-tile"><image src="{{item.path}}" mode="aspectFill" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="previewPhoto"/><button class="photo-remove" aria-label="移除照片" data-index="{{index}}" catchtap="removePhoto" disabled="{{busy}}">×</button></view><button wx:if="{{photos.length<6}}" class="photo-add" bindtap="addPhotos" loading="{{photoBusy}}" disabled="{{busy || photoBusy}}">＋<view>添加照片</view></button></view><view class="muted photo-note">记录滑梯和周边环境，发布时上传。请避免拍到他人正脸。</view></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">03　大家想知道的</text><view class="row"><picker class="grow" range="{{types}}" data-field="type" bindchange="select"><view class="select">{{form.type}} ▾</view></picker><picker class="grow" range="{{ages}}" data-field="ageBand" bindchange="select"><view class="select">{{form.ageBand}} ▾</view></picker></view></view>
<view class="row"><picker class="cost-picker" range="{{costs}}" data-field="cost" bindchange="select"><view class="select">{{form.cost}} ▾</view></picker><input class="input grow" placeholder="开放时间（选填）" maxlength="80" value="{{form.openingHours}}" data-field="openingHours" bindinput="input" /></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">配套设施（选填）</text><view class="option-grid"><button wx:for="{{amenities}}" wx:key="label" class="chip {{item.selected?'active':''}}" data-value="{{item.label}}" bindtap="amenity">{{item.label}}</button></view></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">停车情况（选填）</text><view class="option-grid"><button wx:for="{{parkingOptions}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{form.parking===item?'active':''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="parking">{{item}}</button></view></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">停车场地址（选填）</text><input class="input" placeholder="停车场名称、入口或详细地址" maxlength="160" value="{{form.parkingAddress}}" data-field="parkingAddress" bindinput="input"/><button class="ghost small parking-picker" bindtap="chooseParking">◎ 在地图上选择停车场</button></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">交通信息（选填）</text><textarea class="textarea traffic" placeholder="地铁或公交路线、步行入口、骑行提示、停车费用等" maxlength="500" value="{{form.traffic}}" data-field="traffic" bindinput="input"/><view class="count muted">{{form.traffic.length}} / 500</view></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">04　分享你的发现 *</text><textarea class="textarea" placeholder="滑梯是什么样的？适合多大的孩子？有什么到访小贴士？（至少5个字）" maxlength="1000" value="{{form.description}}" data-field="description" bindinput="input"/><view class="count muted">{{form.description.length}} / 1000</view></view>
<view class="notice">分享内容和昵称将公开展示。请分享真实到访体验，避免填写个人联系方式。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view>
<view wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}" class="notice">发布需要微信登录，点击下方按钮即可登录。填写内容会保留。</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || photoBusy}}" bindtap="submit">{{!loggedIn?'微信登录并发布':editingId?'保存更新':'＋ 把快乐标在地图上'}}</button><button wx:if="{{editingId}}" class="ghost section" bindtap="cancelEdit">取消编辑，开始新的分享</button><view class="draft-note muted">未发布的内容会自动保存为本机草稿</view></view><privacy-dialog id="privacy"/>
